#3400
The Tunnels~
The uncompromising, black granite walls reflect the flickering light 
back in a thousand ways, making this place seem surreal, almost otherwordly.
There are no sounds of movement or voices at all, only the steady, quiet 
drip of the caverns' moist walls. 
~
